      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Polys don’t actually cause lag. FPS drops are entirely based on the amount of drawcalls the game has to make because of how many materials your avatar has. Here is my source:\nhttps://vrcat.club/threads/what-is-optimization-and-why-is-it-important.65/",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
